      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DEFIANT CODE (2) goes on top off a strong debut effort that reads better than sixth suggests, not beaten far when charging hard late. Is sure to have come on from that and can get the job done this time. STAR ROUGE (5) finished alongside him in the same race after racing closer to the action. Warrants obvious consideration off that with natural improvement anticipated. HIT A LICK (8) brings the most exposed form though is patchy. Has been showing good tactical speed, so expect Butler to take advantage of the low draw and run them along. Debutant FEARLESS VICTOR (3) has come along nicely in two trials and gets a key booking in Maloney from a favourable draw. Ant market push should be respected.",
